@page "/"

<PageTitle>@Title</PageTitle>

<GdsBreadcrumbs Items="@Breadcrumbs" />

<GdsHeading Level="1">Flood Online Reporting Tool</GdsHeading>

<div>
    <p>Multiple groups are responsible for flood risk so we will attempt to forward your report to the correct place.</p>
    
    <p>You can then manage your flood report via this site and see any responses you receive.</p>
    
    <GdsWarning Text="It is a legal requirement to report past flooding to potential buyers when selling a property." />
    
    <GdsStartButton Href="@FloodReportPages.Home.Url" Text="Start a new flood report" />
</div>

<div>
    <p>You can also update an existing record if you have provided contact details.</p>

    <GdsInsetText>
        You will require the reference and access code which should have been sent to you in order to use this service.
    </GdsInsetText>

    <GdsStartButton Href="@FloodReportPages.Overview.Url" Text="Manage an existing report" />
</div>